{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/November-Trailer-2023__online-video-cutter.com_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start on an epic adventure of square proportions! Explore mysterious zones, conquer challenging puzzles, and engage in thrilling battles with fierce foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the full potential of your hero by collecting powerful items scattered throughout the land. The greatest of adventurers will discover hidden treasures waiting for only the bravest of explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/about-gameplay-heading.png?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parry bullets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once discovered, the <i>Parry Bullet</i> power allows you to parry incoming bullets and reflect them back at enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/HeroSquare_2025-04-12_13-24-25__online-video-cutter.com_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore for secrets!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Does it look like a good fit? In HeroSquare secrets are everywhere, and good positioning is the key to many of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/HeroSquare_2025-04-12_14-37-14__online-video-cutter.com_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your adventure you will add new abilities and upgrades to your arsenal. Master them to reach the finale of HeroSquare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/HeroSquare_2024-11-30_12-08-07__online-video-cutter.com___1_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Triumph in battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will face tough bosses determined to stop your progress. However there's always a way forward, especially if one looks around a bit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/HeroSquare_2025-01-31_10-47-16__online-video-cutter.com___1___1_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/about-story-heading.png?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We find our hero stranded under the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you ended up here is a mystery, and so is the exact nature of this colorful world, that you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One memory however remains, something once had, but now lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere in this world, a heart awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/HeroSquare_2024-09-20_19-43-52__online-video-cutter.com_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/about-features-heading.png?t=1744458410\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience metroidvania like it's 1982</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 large zones, each with unique enemies, power ups and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorful visuals pulsing with an arcade glow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple intuitive controls (keyboard or gamepad supported!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack with a unique chiptune style created for HeroSquare + handcrafted sound fx</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/wishlist-ghost.png?t=1744458410\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2440500?t=1744458410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744458410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744458410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744458410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2451810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2440500/extras/November-Trailer-2023__online-video-cutter.com_.gif?t=1744458410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start on an epic adventure of square proportions! Explore mysterious zones, conquer challenging puzzles, and engage in thrilling battles with fierce foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the full potential of your hero by collecting powerful items scattered throughout the land. The greatest of adventurers will discover hidden treasures waiting for only the bravest of explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"